y .... much .....> > >  [A[A  [B                                            Confused 潇洒 ...泣血...          很简单。。。。只要在冒险者公会楼上等reborn,就可以得到一把小刀(knife)  ,卖了就可以得到4 silver.............^_^...............................                                                007....:P","time":780799185,"poster":"James",]),(["id":25,"body":"","title":"< no title >","time":780809957,"poster":"Bamboo",]),(["id":26,"body":"","title":"< no title >","time":780809959,"poster":"Bamboo",]),})
